{"id": "13513", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13513", "title": "Indwari", "text": "UMUNSI W`INTWARI MU URWANDA\nUbutwari 2023 U Rwanda rurizihiza umunsi w`Intwari kunshuro ya 29.\nBurimwaka taliki1 Gashyantare abanyarwanda n`inshuti z`u Rwanda bizihiza umunsi w`intwari.\nU Rwanda rwibuka intwari zarwo mu rwego rwokuziha icyubahiro no\ngutera ishyaka abakiri bato kugirango nabo bazabe intwari mubindi bihe. \nubusanzwe mu Rwanda intwari zirimubyiciro bitatu ari byo:Imanzi, Imena n`Ingenzi.\nINTWARI NI MUNTU KI?\nintwari ni uumtu ukurikirana ibyo yiyemeje\nkugeraho bikavamo igikorwa cyikirenga gifitiye abandi akamaro,\nakabikora mu bupfura, mu kwihangana no mu bwitange buhebuje \nkandi akirinda ubugwari mu migirire ye, ntagamburuzwe namananiza.\nANDI MAKURU ARAMBUYE WAYASHAKIRA HANO\nhttps://www.google.com/search?q=inyarwanda+ubutwari+2022&amp;rlz=1C1HLDY_enRW955RW955&amp;ei=bwLQY4roCcvVkdUP2_adwAs&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjK25LJy-D8AhXLaqQEHVt7B7gQ4dUDCA8&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=inyarwanda+ubutwari+2022&amp;gs_lcp=Cgxnd3Mtd2l6LXNlcnAQAzIFCCEQoAE6CggAEEcQ1gQQsANKBAhBGABKBAhGGABQtgZYlSlgsEloAXABeACAAdAYiAGSJZIBCTMtMi4yLjktMZgBAKABAcgBAsABAQ&amp;sclient=gws-wiz-serp"}
{"id": "13514", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13514", "title": "Intwari yu urwanda", "text": "AMATEKA\nMajor General Fred Gisa RWIGEMA \nyaranzwe nubwitange buhebuje ubwo yayoboraga ingabo\nza FPR Inkotanyi kurugamba rwo kubohora u Rwanda\nmu mwaka wa 1990 nyuma akarugwaho. yabereye abandi \nurugero rwiza rwubwitange bashobora gukurikiza.\nINKOMOKO YE\nyavukiye i Mukiranze mu karere ka kamonyi mu ntara ya amajyepfo\nku wa 10 Mata 1957. Ni mwene Anastasi kimonyo na Gatarina Mukandilima.\nyashakanye na Jeannette Urujeni basezerana ku wac 20 kamena 1987.\nbabyaranye abana babiri aribo Gisa Junior na Gisa teta.\nyatabarutse ku wa 2 ukwakira 1990 i kagitumba mu karere kanyagatare\nmu ntara yiburasirazuba agwa ku rugamba amaze gutangiza intambara\nyo kubohora u Rwanda.\nNi intwari iri mu cyiciro cy`imanzi yagaragaje umutima wa kigabo mu\nrwego ruhebuje mumibereho ye yose.\n\"Amakuru arambuye ajyanye n` intwara z` u Rwanda.\""}
{"id": "13515", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13515", "title": "Umunezero", "text": "Umunezero.\nhakurikijwe ubushakashatsi butandukanye bwagiye bukorwa,\nabahanga bagerageje gusobanura UMUNEZERO.\nbavugako,UMUNEZERO arimugari kandi uharanirwa \nTwakuramo iki m 'umunezero?\nUMUNEZERO uduha ubuzima bwiza,tukaba twatekereza neza,\nntarwara yubwonko cg ingaruka mubuzima bwacu bwa burimunsi.\nubushakashatsi kandi nanone bwavuze ko,kuba mumwanya wanone \nkuticira imanza, nogukora ibikorwa byurukundo nabyo bizana urukundo."}
{"id": "13516", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13516", "title": "Ibingira Fred", "text": "Gen (Rtd)Fred Ibingira.\nRetired General Ibingira Fred yavutse mu mwaka wi 1964 avukira mugihugu cyabaturanyi cya Uganda ubwo bari mu buhungiro\nakaba ari naho yize amashuri asanzwe ahitwa Gisozi senior secondary school muri Uganda\nImirimo ye numwuga.\nIbingira Fred yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye mu mwuga we wa Gisirikare harimo nko kuyobora Batayo zitandukanye nka\nMu 1987,yabae Umuyobozi wa Platon Mu 1988,nabwo aba Umuyobozi w'ikigo cya gisirikare, Mu 1989 nabwo aba Umuyobozi wungirije wa Batayo 7 BN Mugihe cy'intambara yo kwibohora; yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa batayo wungirije Task Force A mu 1990 Mu 1991 aba Komanda Batayo 7, muri uwo mwaka kandi yabaye Komanda wa batayo A Mobile Force. \nIndi mirimo yakoze.\nKuva mu mwaka wa 2003 kugeza 2010 yabaye Umuyobozi wa Diviziyo 1Div. umwanya yari afite kugeza agizwe Umuyobozi mukuru w'ingabo\nmu Rwanda.\nUmuryango we.\nGen Ibingira yashakanye na Marie Claire Munganyinka bafitanye abana batatu.\nkugeza akaba ari mu basirikare bakuru, Perezida wa Repubulika aherutse kwemera ubusabe bwabo bwo gusezera mu ngabo. Rwanda (Reserve Forces)"}
{"id": "13517", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13517", "title": "Rayon Sports Women Football Club", "text": "Rayon sport ni ikipe ubundi bamwe bakunda kwita gikundiro. Rayon sport yashinzwe muri gicurasi 1965 kuri stade regionale i kigali.\nRayon Sports Women Football Club ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikaba iri muri Shampiyona yu Rwanda m\u2019Icyiciro cya Kabiri mu Bagore. Ikipe ya Rayon Sports ya bagore ikaba yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri mu mupira w\u2019amaguru w\u2019abagore, ni umukino w'abereye kuri Sitade ya Bugesera, aho yatsinze ikipe y\u2019Indahangarwa byari bihanganye, akaba aricyo gikombe cy'ambere itwaye kuva yashingwa."}
{"id": "13518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13518", "title": "IManizabayo Florence", "text": "Imanizabayo Florence avuka mu Karere ka Rubavu, ni bucura mu muryango w\u2019abana bane. Imanizabayo Florence ni umukinnyi akaba ari rutahizamu w'ikipe ya Kampala Queens FC yo muri Uganda, ni ikipe ikinamo abagore gusa ya KCCA aho ikina Shampiyona y\u2019Icyiciro cya Mbere muri Uganda Yashinzwe mu 2016, ikaba yeregukana Igikombe cya Shampiyona, ibyo bikaba biyihesha kuzasohokera igihugu cya Uganda mu mikino ya CAF Women\u2019s Champions League. Yasinyiye mu gihe cyigera ku myaka ibiri 2, ni nyuma yo kuva mw' ikipe ya Rayon Sports Women Football Club. Yatsinze ibitego 60 mu mwaka we wa mbere muriyo ikipe, aho yayifashije iyi kipe kwegukana Igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019Icyiciro cya Kabiri mu mwaka wayo wa mbere mu Rwanda no kugera ku mukino wa nyuma mu gikombe cy'amahoro na AS Kigali y'abagore ibitego 3 kuri 2. Florence ni umukinnyi wa Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda y'umupira w'amaguru y'abagore.\nGukina umupira.\nImanizabayo Florence umupira w\u2019amaguru yawutangiye yiga mu mashuri abanza mu Karere ka Rubavu, ubwo umutoza wamufashije kuzamura impano z\u2019abato, witwa \u2019Vigoureux\u2019. Yakiniye amakipe ya Remera Rukoma, ayivamo yinjira muri AS Kigali yakiniye imyaka itanu, aza kubengukwa na Rayon Sports Women Football Club."}
{"id": "13520", "revid": "14594", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13520", "title": "Budisime", "text": "Budisime (Buddhism) ni idini na filozofiya byateye imbere bivuye ku nyigisho za Budha. \nBudha yari umwarimu w\u2019umuhinde wabaga mu majyaruguru yUbuhinde hagati yikinyejana cya 6 na hagati ya 5 MIC. Kuva mu Buhinde kugera muri Aziya yo hagati no mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Aziya, Ubushinwa, Koreya, n'Ubuyapani, Budisime yagize uruhare runini mu mibereho y'umwuka, umuco, n'imibereho ya Aziya, kandi, guhera mu kinyejana cya 20, ikwira mu Burengerazuba."}
{"id": "13521", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13521", "title": "Ashoka", "text": "Ashoka (304 - 232 BGC) yari umwami wa gatatu w'ingoma ya Maurya yo ku mugabane w'Ubuhinde mu 268 gushika 232 BGC. \nIngoma ye yari ifite igice kinini cy\u2019umugabane w\u2019Ubuhinde, guhera kuri Afuganisitani y'ubu mu burengerazuba kugera muri Bangladesh y'ubu mu burasirazuba, n'umurwa mukuru wa Pataliputra. Yari umurinzi w'Ababuda. ashimirwa ko yagize uruhare runini mu gukwirakwiza Budisime muri Aziya ya kera."}
{"id": "13522", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13522", "title": "William Ruto", "text": "William Kipchirchir Samoei Arap Ruto (yavutse ku ya 21 Ukuboza 1966) ni umunyapolitiki wa Kenya, Perezida wa gatanu w'icyo gihugu kuva ku ya 13 Nzeri 2022. Mbere yaho, yabaye Visi-Perezida wa mbere watowe wa Kenya, ku butegetsi bwa Uhuru Kenyatta, kuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2022. Yabaye umudepite wa Eldoret y'Amajyaruguru kuva mu 1997 kugeza mu 2013, Minisitiri w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu (2002), uw'Ubuhinzi (2008\u20132010) n'uw'Amashuri Makuru (2010). Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga (CPI) rwamukurikiranyeho ibyaha byibasiye inyokomuntu bifitanye isano n'urugomo rwakurikiye amatora ya 2007, ariko mu 2016 urubanza rwe ruraseswa. Mu 2022, yatsinze Raila Odinga mu matora ya perezida, itsinzi yemejwe n'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga. Ku butegetsi bwe, Kenya yabaye igihugu cya mbere cyo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara cyagizwe umufatanyabikorwa ukomeye wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika utari muri OTAN, ariko imyigaragambyo yo mu 2024 yamaganaga itegeko ry'imari yahosheshejwe ku ngufu.\nUbuzima bwe bwa mbere n'amashuri.\nRuto ni Umukalenjin w'inkomoko ivanze y'Abakipsigis n'Abanandi; se ni Daniel Cheruiyot, naho nyina ni Sarah Cheruiyot. Yavukiye i Sambut, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'umujyi wa Eldoret, mu karere ka Uasin Gishu, mu muryango ukennye w'abahinzi n'aborozi. Akiri muto, yaragiraga intama n'inka, akanafasha ababyeyi be mu mirima; yize amashuri abanza atambaye inkweto. Kugira ngo abone amafaranga, yacuruzaga inkoko ku muhanda, inkuru yakunze kuvuga mu bukangurambaga bwe.\nYize amashuri abanza ya Kamagut na Kerotet, ayisumbuye muri Wareng no muri Kapsabet High School. Yize ibijyanye n'ibimera n'inyamaswa muri Kaminuza ya Nairobi, ayirangiza mu 1990, hanyuma ahabona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu bidukikije by'ibimera, n'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD) ku ya 21 Ukuboza 2018. Muri kaminuza, yari umuyoboke ukomeye w'ihuriro ry'Abakristo n'umuyobozi wa korari, ari na ho yamenyaniye na Perezida Daniel arap Moi.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nNyuma ya kaminuza, yabaye umwarimu w'agateganyo kuva mu 1990 kugeza mu 1992. Yatangiye politiki ari umubitsi w'itsinda rya Youth for KANU '92 (YK'92), ryashyigikiraga kongera gutorwa kwa Moi mu matora ya 1992. Iryo tsinda ryavuzweho gutoteza Abakikuyu bashyigikiraga Mwai Kibaki, kandi bivugwa ko Ruto yahakuye umutungo munini.\nMu matora ya 1997, yatsinze umudepite wari uri ku mwanya, Reuben Chesire, wari ushyigikiwe na Moi, aba umudepite wa Eldoret y'Amajyaruguru. Mu 2002, Moi yamugize Minisitiri wungirije w'Umutekano w'Imbere mu Gihugu, hanyuma Minisitiri wuzuye. Ishyaka KANU ryatsinzwe amatora ya 2002, ariko Ruto agumana umwanya we w'ubudepite, maze mu 2005 aba umunyamabanga mukuru wa KANU. Mu 2005, yari umwe mu bayobozi b'ihuriro ryiswe Orange Democratic Movement (ODM), ryarwanyije umushinga w'Itegeko Nshinga muri kamarampaka. Mu matora y'ibanze ya ODM yo mu 2007, yabaye uwa gatatu inyuma ya Raila Odinga na Musalia Mudavadi, hanyuma ashyigikira Odinga.\nIbyavuye mu matora ya perezida yo mu Ukuboza 2007 byateje urugomo rukomeye mu gihugu. Muri guverinoma y'ubumwe yashyizweho muri Mata 2008, Ruto yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ubuhinzi, hanyuma mu 2010 Minisitiri w'Amashuri Makuru. Mu 2013, Urukiko Rukuru rwamutegetse gusubiza umurima yari yarigaruriye mu gihe cy'urugomo rwa 2007\u20132008.\nUrubanza muri CPI.\nMu Ukuboza 2010, umushinjacyaha w'Urukiko Mpanabyaha Mpuzamahanga (CPI) yasabye ko abantu batandatu, barimo Ruto, bitaba urukiko kubera uruhare rwabo mu rugomo rwakurikiye amatora ya 2007, rwahitanye abantu bagera ku 1 200, abandi bagera ku 600 000 bakava mu byabo. Yashinjwe ibyaha bitatu byibasiye inyokomuntu: ubwicanyi, kwimura abaturage ku ngufu no gutoteza. Ruto yahakanye ibyo birego. Muri Mata 2016, CPI yahagaritse urubanza, ivuga ko gutera ubwoba abatangabuhamya no kwivanga kwa politiki \u00abbitihanganirwa\u00bb byatumye rudashobora gukomeza.\nVisi-Perezida (2013\u20132022).\nMu matora ya 2013, Ruto yihuje na Uhuru Kenyatta, ihuriro rigamije kubungabunga amahoro hagati y'Abakikuyu n'Abakalenjin bari barahanganye mu matora yabanje. Batsinze amatora, Ruto aba Visi-Perezida. Kuva ku ya 6 kugeza ku ya 9 Ukwakira 2014, yabaye perezida w'agateganyo mu gihe Kenyatta yari yitabye CPI i La Haye. Mu 2017, bongeye gutorwa, nyuma y'uko Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rutesheje agaciro amatora ya mbere.\nMu manda ya kabiri, umubano we na Kenyatta warazambye, maze Kenyatta ashyigikira Raila Odinga mu matora ya 2022. Mu Ukuboza 2020, Ruto yinjiye mu ishyaka rishya rya United Democratic Alliance (UDA).\nPerezida wa Kenya.\nAmatora ya 2022.\nKu ya 15 Kanama 2022, umuyobozi wa komisiyo y'amatora, Wafula Chebukati, yatangaje ko Ruto yatsinze amatora n'amajwi 50,49%, imbere ya Raila Odinga (48,85%) ; ariko bane mu bagize komisiyo barindwi banze ibyo byavuye mu matora. Odinga yitabaje Urukiko rw'Ikirenga, rwemeje itsinzi ya Ruto ku ya 5 Nzeri 2022. Ruto yarahiriye kuba Perezida ku ya 13 Nzeri 2022.\nPolitiki y'imbere mu gihugu.\nMu Ugushyingo 2022, guverinoma ye yatangije ikigega cyitwa \"Hustler Fund\", gitanga inguzanyo zihuse ku baturage. Mu 2023, yatangije gahunda yagutse yo kwegurira abikorera ibigo bya leta. Yiyemeje kandi ko Kenya izareka gukoresha ibicanwa bikomoka mu butaka mu gukora amashanyarazi bitarenze 2030, kandi atangiza gahunda yo gutera ibiti miliyari 15 bitarenze 2032.\nMuri Kamena 2024, umushinga w'itegeko ry'imari wongeraga imisoro ku bicuruzwa by'ibanze, wasabwaga na FMI kugira ngo leta ibashe kwishyura umwenda, wateje imyigaragambyo itigeze ibaho mu mijyi myinshi. Polisi yishe abigaragambyaga benshi, maze Ruto akuraho uwo mushinga, ndetse ku ya 11 Nyakanga 2024 yirukana abenshi mu bagize guverinoma. Imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu yamaganye ubugome bw'inzego z'umutekano, ishimutwa n'iyicwa ry'abantu batavuga rumwe na leta. Muri Nzeri 2026, yatangaje ko ashaka kubuza abimukira gukora imirimo imwe n'imwe.\nUbubanyi n'amahanga.\nRuto yagaragaje Kenya nk'umufatanyabikorwa w'ingenzi w'ibihugu by'Iburengerazuba, maze Kenya iba igihugu cya mbere cyo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara cyagizwe na Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika \u00abumufatanyabikorwa ukomeye utari muri OTAN\u00bb. Yayoboye inama ya mbere y'Afurika ku mihindagurikire y'ibihe i Nairobi mu 2023, yasohoyemo itangazo rya Nairobi risaba umusoro mpuzamahanga ku byuka bihumanya n'ivugururwa ry'imiyoborere y'imari ku isi. Yagize uruhare mu buhuza mu karere, harimo ibiganiro bya Nairobi bigamije guhagarika imirwano mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Muri Nzeri 2024, yasinyanye n'Ubudage amasezerano yemerera abakozi b'Abanyakenya bagera ku 250 000 gukora muri icyo gihugu.\nUbutegetsi bwe bwanenzwe ku ruhare rwabwo mu ntambara ya Sudani: mu 2024 no mu 2025, bwashinjwe korohereza umutwe wa RSF, ndetse muri Gashyantare 2025 Kenya yakira isinywa ry'amasezerano ya RSF n'abafatanyabikorwa bayo yo gushyiraho guverinoma ibangikanye; guverinoma ya Kenya yahakanye kubogama, ivuga ko ari umuhuza utabogamye.\nImpaka.\nRuto yagiye avugwaho ibirego byinshi, birimo amakimbirane ku butaka n'ikibazo cy'ibigori cyo mu 2009. Mu 2018, ubushakashatsi bwa Ipsos Kenya bwagaragaje ko 33% by'ababajijwe bamufataga nk'umunyapolitiki urya ruswa kurusha abandi, ibyo we yise \u00abibihuha\u00bb. Mu 2024, yashyizwe ku isonga n'abantu barenga 40 000 mu matora y'umuryango OCCRP w'\u00abumuntu w'umwaka\u00bb mu bya ruswa, nubwo akanama k'uwo muryango katamuhisemo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMu 1991, Ruto yashakanye na Rachel Chebet mu Itorero rya Africa Inland Church. Ni Umukristo w'Umuvanjeliste. Ni umwe mu bantu bakize kurusha abandi muri Kenya; afite umurima w'inkoko iwabo i Sugoi, ndetse n'ishoramari mu mahoteli."}
{"id": "13523", "revid": "122619", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13523", "title": "Sam Kaka", "text": "Sam Kaka Ubundi Amazinaye Ni:Sam Kanyemera wamenyekanye kwizina rya kaka.\nSam Kaka Yari Umusirikare mu Ngabo zurwanda RDF.\nSam Kaka Yavuye Mu Gisirikare afite ipeti rya Generali Major (Major General).\nSam Kaka Kanyemera Yabaye umugaba mukuru W'Ingabo Z'Urwanda.\nAmashuri Yize..\nRtd Sam Kaka Yabonye Impamya Bumenyi yikirenga mu Mategeko mpuzamahanga Mpanabyaha."}
{"id": "13524", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13524", "title": "Urugamba Rwokubohora Igihugu cy'u Rwanda Kagitumba", "text": "Urugamba rwo kubohora igihugu\nU Rwanda rwizihiza umunsi wo kwibohora byakozwe n\u2019ingabo za RPA zari zishamikiye kumuryango FPR-Inkotanyi watangije igikorwa tariki ya 1 Ukwakira mu mwaka 1990.FPR(Rwanda Patriotic Front).\nIbyaranze Urugamba rwokubohora Igihugu.\nNi igikorwa cyatangirijwe kumupaka wa Kagitumba kuri ubu uherereye mu Karere ka Nyagatare mu Murenge wa Matimba, ahagana saa yine z\u2019amanywa ngo nibwo isasu rya mbere ryumvikanye ry\u2019izi ngabo zari iza RPA.Izi ngabo za RPA zari zigizwe n\u2019urubyiruko rw\u2019abanyarwanda bari barambiwe kuba mu buzima bw\u2019ubuhunzi kuko bari barirukanwe mu Rwanda mu mwaka 1959 bazizwa ko ari abatutsi.Nyuma yo gutera ngo uwari ubayoboye ariwe Maj Gen Gisa Fred Rwigema yabasabye kwiyambura amapeti ya Uganda ubundi bakarangamira kuzambikwa ay\u2019igihugu cyabo bari bamaze kwinjiramo.Hakurikiyeho kubacamo ibice cyangwa ibyobita batayo iya mbere n\u2019iya kane aziha kwerekeza umuhanda Kagitumba Kigali, iya gatandatu n\u2019iya cyenda zikata ku ruhande mu muhanda werekeza Kagitumba Nyagatare."}
{"id": "13526", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13526", "title": "Abana b'Inyange", "text": "Ubutwari bw'abana b'Inyange mu Rwanda.\nIshuri ryisumbuye ry'Inyange riri mucyahoze ari kivumu muri perefegitura ya kibuye ubu akaba ari mu karere ka ngororero, iri shuri ryaranzwe kandi rimenyekana cyane mugihe abacengezi bateraga u Rwanda mu mwaka wa 1997, ubwo abana bahigaga banze kwitandukanya mu moko bashaka kwica abatutsi maze bakabwira abacengezi ko bose ari abanyarwanda, bikabaviramo no kwicwa bamwe.\nIbikorwa by'ubutwari byakozwe n;abana b'inyange.\nMu mwaka wa 1997 nibwo abacengezi binjiye muri iryo shuri maze basaba abana kwitandukana bagira bati abatusi ukwabo n'abahutu ukwabo, maze abana nabo basubiza bagira bati twe turi abanyarwanda, hari hashize imyaka itatu (3) Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda irangiye, bivuzengo ibikomere ndetse n'ingaruka byari bikiri mu banyarwanda gusa uburere n'indangagaciro abarezi babo ndetse n'umuryango FPR INKOTANYI bari bamaze kubatoza, byatumye abana bafata umwanzuro wo kutitandukanya bemera kwitwa abanyarwanda bose bimika ndi Umunyarwanda, bemera gushyira hamwe no gutabarana batitaye kungaruka zari bukurikire.\nIbyaranze bamwe muribo.\nAmakuru avugako harimo umwana wari ufite papa we umubyara wari ufungiye ibyaha bya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi, maze ubwo abacengezi binjiraga umwana amenyamo umwe maze amusaba imbabazi ngo abababarire ntibicwe, maze umucengezi nawe amusaba kumutandukanyiriza abatutsi umwana nawe aratsemba avuga ko bose ari abanyarwanda.\nIntandaro.\nAbana b'Inyange baje kwigira inama yo gusohoka biruka batabaza, kugirango bamenyeshe n'abandi ko batewe maze bahunge, nuko abacengezi babateramo gerenade ihitana abagera kuri batandatu (6) abandi barakomereka bikabije.\nKugeza ubu.\nKugeza ubu mu Rwanda hari ubyiciro bigera kuri bitatu by'Intwari aribyo: IMANZI, IMENA, n'INGENZI. Akaba ari bamwe mubagize ubutwari bwo kurinda u Rwanda n'abanyarwanda birengagije inyungu zabo bwite.\nImena.\nImena nicyo kiciro abana b'Inyange babarizwamo kugeza ubu, kubera ubutwari bagaragaje no gushyigikira\nubunyarwanda batitaye kunyungu zabo bwite kugeza ubwo bibaviriyemo kwitwa Intwari z'igihugu."}
{"id": "13528", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13528", "title": "David Rwabinumi", "text": "David Rwabinumi Umunyarwanda wabaye mungabo Z'Urwanda Aho yarari Munkotanyi 600 zari munteko ishinga amategeko y'urwanda (CND). Mugihe cya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi Muri Mata 1994.\nMurugamba rwo kubohora igihugu David Rwabinumi niwe wakoreshaga imbunda Yubakiwe ikimenyetso kugisenge cy'iyi nyubako.\nDavid Rwabinumi Ubu akaba yaravuye mugisirikare cy'urwanda afite ipeti rya Major (RTD Major David Rwabinumi).\nIbirushijeho..\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/umutekano/imbere-mu-gihugu/article/ganira-na-rtd-maj-david-rwabinumi-wazahaje-inzirabwoba-arashisha-iyi-mbunda"}
{"id": "13529", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13529", "title": "Mukambaraga Beatrice", "text": "Ku mugoroba w\u2019itariki 18 Werurwe 1997, abanyeshuri bigaga mu mwaka wa gatanu n\u2019uwa gatandatu mu Ishuri ryisumbuye ry\u2019i Nyange, batewe n\u2019abacengezi babasaba kwitandukanya bakurikije amoko, abanyeshuri basubiriza rimwe bati: \u201cTwese turi Abanyarwanda\u201d, bibabera intandaro yo kuraswa, bamwe bahasiga ubuzima, abandi barakomereka.\nMukambaraga Beatrice ni umwe mu babuze ubuzima muri icyo gitero, ariko ku bwo kwimakaza ubunyarwanda bashyirwa mu Ntwari z\u2019igihugu icyiciro cy\u2019Imena.\nImva y\u2019imwe mu Mena zishyinguye i Nyange..\nBuri tariki ya mbere Gashyantare, u Rwanda rwibuka intwari zaharaniye inyungu z\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019Ubunyarwanda kurusha inyungu zabo bwite, cyangwa iz\u2019abantu bamwe. Intwari z\u2019u Rwanda zirimo ibyiciro bitatu: Imanzi, Imena n\u2019Ingenzi.\nZimwe mu ntwari z\u2019u Rwanda harimo Maj. Gen. Gisa Fred Rwigema, Umwami Mutara Rudahigwa, Agathe Uwiringiyimana, Felicite Niyitegeka, Michel Rwagasana n\u2019abana bigaga mu ishuri ryisumbuye ry\u2019i Nyange mu mwaka w\u20191997."}
{"id": "13530", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13530", "title": "Jackson Rwahama", "text": "LT CORONEL Jackson Rwahama.\nLt coloneri Rwahama ni umwe mu ngabo zigihugu zagize uruhare mu rugamba rwo guhagarika Genocide yakorewe abatutsi\nmu Rwanda mu mwaka wi 1994 gusa kuri ubu akaba ari mungabo zavuye kurugerero.\nAmateka.\nLt coroneli Rwahama Jackson uretse kuba yaragize uruhare muguhagarika Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda\nadaharaniyye inyyungu ze yaje no kwitirirwa agace kamwe mumuji wa Kigali ahazwi nko kwa Rwahama kuko ari umwe\nmubahazamuye inzu umuturirwa bwa mbere mu mwaka wi 1995 Genocide ikirangira\nIndi mirimo.\nLt Coronel Jackson Rwahama yayoboye kenshi ingabo zu Rwanda mu gihe cyo kubohora igihugu\nRwahama kandi yabae umuyobozi mukuru wubutasi bwa Gisirikare mu Rwanda (RPA)"}
{"id": "13531", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13531", "title": "Tuyisenge Eric", "text": "Tuyisenge Eric (wavutse ku ya 25 Ugushyingo 1990) bakunze kwita Cantona yahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Rwanda. Kugeza ubu ni umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikoresho (Kit manager) mu ikipe yumupira w'amaguru y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwambere &amp; Umwuga.\nEric wavutse mu 1990 i Remera hafi ya stade Amahoro, yatangiriye urugendo rwe rw'umupira w'amaguru mu ikipe y'abato ya Esp\u00e9rance FC nyuma aza kwinjira mu ikipe yabato ya Les Citandins muri iki gihe AS Kigali FC. Tuyisenge yatangiye umwuga we nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikoresho muri 2012 muri Isonga Fc, ikipe yashinzwe nyuma y\u2019igikombe cyisi cya FIFA U17 2011 muri Mexico. Mu mwaka wa 2011, Eric yatoranijwe bwa mbere nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikoresho mu itsinda rya tekinike ry\u2019agateganyo ry\u2019u Rwanda U-20, kuva icyo gihe akora nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ibikoresho mu ikipe y'u Rwanda U17, U20 na U23. Mu 2022, yatangajwe ku muyobozi wa kit mu ikipe nkuru y'umupira w'amaguru yu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "13532", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13532", "title": "Twahirwa ludovic", "text": "Twahirwa Iudovic wamenyekanye nka Coronel Dodo ni umwe mubasirikare bagize uruhare mu rugamba rwo \nkubohora igihugu kuva mu mwaka wi 1990 mu Rwanda ubwo ingabo za RPF zinjiraga mu Rwanda ari umwe \nmubimbere kuko ari afite ipete rya Kapieni yaherewe mugihugu cy'abaturanyye Uganda\nTwahirwa Ludovic(Coronel Dodo).\nTwahirwa ni umwe mungabo zagize uruhare mu rugamba rwo kubohora igihugu kuva mu mwaka wi 1990\nkandi yari umwe mubimbere barongoye ingabo zu Rwanda yiteguye gukora buri kimwe habe no guhara ubuzima\nariko igihugu nabanyarwanda batabarwe kandi atitaye kunyungu ze bwite. \nUko yinjiye mu mwuga we w'Igisirikare.\nCoronel Dodo yavukiye mu gihugu cyabaturanyi Uganda ahagana mu mwaka wi 1960 kubabyeyi bimpunzi\nz'abanyarwanda mu majyaruguru ya Uganda yavutse iwabo ari abatunzi boroyye Inka nyinshi gusa yaje\ngutangira ubuzima bushya mu mwaka wi 1981 ubwo Yinjiraga mu gisirikare cya Uganda mu myyaka isaga\nitandatu gusa (6) yari ahawe ipei rya Kapiteni kubera ibikorwa bye byyindashyikirwa ni ntambara nyinshi\narwaniye mugihugu cya Uganda\nImirimoye kuri Ubu.\nCoronel Dodo kandi n'umwe mubagize uruhare mu bikorwa by'ubutwari nkaho yatangije ibikorwa by'ingendo\nRusange mumujyi wa Kigali byo gutwara abantu ndetse no hanze y'Umujyi wa Kigali ahasaga mu mwaka wi 1999 nyuma yo kujya mu kiruhuko kizabukuru mu mwaka wi 1998 "}
{"id": "13533", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13533", "title": "Urwego rushinzwe intwari z'igihugu, imidari n'impeta by'ishimwe", "text": "= Amavu n'amavuko =\nUrwego rw'igihugu rushinzwe intwari z'ighugu, imidari n'impeta by'ishimwe rwabayeho nyuma y'inama y'abaminisitiri yateranye ku italiki 31 Ukuboza 1995, igashyiraho komisiyo yari ifite inshingano zirimo:\nIyi komisiyo yaje gusoza inshingano yari yahawe igaragaje ko intwari z'u Rwanda zikwiriye gushyirwa mu byiciro bitatu aribyo Imena, Imanzi, n'Ingenzi. ndetse yemeje ko umunsi uboneye wo kwizihizaho umunsi w'intwari ari 01 Gashyantare buri mwaka. Inama y\u2019Abaminisitiri yo ku ya 09 Ukuboza 2001, yemeje Intwari 53 z\u2019Ikubitiro, izishyira mu byiciro 2 ari byo Imanzi n\u2019Imena.\n= Inshingano =\nIcyerekezo.\nUru rwego rufite icyerekezo cyo\u00a0 gushyiraho uburyo bwo kugaragaza, gushima, gushimira no kurata Abanyarwanda cyangwa abanyamahanga baranzwe n\u2019ubutwari n\u2019ibindi bikorwa bihebuje byagiriye u Rwanda akamaro ku buryo biba urugero rwiza, nkuko bigenwa n'itegeko N\u00b0 13 bis /2009 ryo kuwa 16/06/2009 rigena Inshingano, Imiterere n\u2019Imikorere by\u2019Urwego rushinzwe Intwari z\u2019Igihugu, Imidari n\u2019Impeta by\u2019Ishimwe.\n= Reba Aha ="}
{"id": "13534", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13534", "title": "Ingoro Ndangamurage y'Amateka y'Urugamba rwo guhagarika Genocide", "text": "Ingoro ndamurage y' amateka y'urugamba rwo guhagarika jenocide yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994; ni imwe mu ngoro ndangamurage umunani ziyobowe n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019umurage ndangamuco ry\u2019u Rwanda (RCHA). Yubatswe mu nyubako y\u2019Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda (CND) (yahoze yitwa \"Conseil National de Development\") ikaba yarafunguwe mu 2017 na Paul Kagame hagamijwe kwerekana amateka y\u2019u Rwanda mu gihe cy'ubukangurambaga bwokurwanya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nInyubako y'inteko ishinga amategeko yatoranijwe nk'ahantu hazabera iyi ngoro ndangamurage kuko yari irimo abasirikare 600 bo mu Rwanda, kuva mu Kuboza 1993 kugeza 1994 mu gihe biteguraga gushyiraho guverinoma y'inzibacyuho yagutse n\u2019Inteko ishinga amategeko y'inzibacyuho. Paul Kagame, Umuyobozi wa RPA w\u2019Ubuyobozi Bukuru, nyuma, mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda, yategetse ko abo basirikare bava mu buroko bwabo kugira ngo bakize Abatutsi ibihumbi bishwe. \nInzu ndangamurage y'urugamba rwo guhagarika jenoside yo mu nteko ishinga amategeko yafunguwe ku ya 4 Nyakanga 2014. \nIntego nyamukuru.\nIntego nyamukuru y\u2019Ubukangurambaga bwo Kurwanya Jenoside ni uburyo yateguwe kandi ikanashyirwa mu bikorwa n\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu cy'uRwanda hatitawe ku kuvana ingabo z\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye mu Rwanda mu gihe cya jenoside. Inzu ndangamurage yerekana kandi uburyo abasirikare magana 600 ba RPA barokoye abahohotewe. Imwe mu nzibutso zizwi cyane ni imbunda ya mashini yakoreshejwe n\u2019ingabo za RPA ziba mu nyubako y\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko mu kugabanya ingufu za jenoside. \nIbindi wamenya.\nIngoro ndamurage y' amateka y'urugamba rwo guhagarika jenocide yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994; irimo ibije bitandukanye bisobanura byimbitse ibice by' amasezerano yasinywe yo guhuza za guverinoma, inama zabaye, n'uragamba rwo guhagarika jenocide.\nBimwe biri munyandiko, mu mashusho na amajwi.\nIhuza ryo hanze.\nCoordinates: &lt;templatestyles src=\"Module:Coordinates/styles.css\"&gt;&lt;/templatestyles&gt;1\u00b057\u203209\u2033S 30\u00b005\u203256\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff1.9526\u00b0S 30.0989\u00b0E\ufeff / -1.9526; 30.0989"}
{"id": "13535", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13535", "title": "Christophe Bazivamo", "text": "Christophe Bazivamo ni Minisitiri w\u2019ubutaka, Ibidukikije, Amashyamba, Amazi, na Mine mu Rwanda. Mu 2003 na 2004 yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019ibanze, iterambere ry\u2019abaturage n\u2019imibereho myiza y'abatutrage. Mu 2005 yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019umutekano mu gihugu. Mu 2000, 2001 na 2002 yabaye umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe amatora. Ni umwe mu bagize urugaga rw\u2019igihugu bakunda igihugu, kandi kuva mu 2002 yabaye visi-perezida w\u2019ishyaka.\nBazivamo ubu ni umwe mu bagize inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019umuryango w\u2019iburasirazuba bwa Afurika."}
{"id": "13536", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13536", "title": "Ivuka rya Koruneliyo", "text": "Ivuka rya Koruneliyo ni umuzingo w'indirimbo watunganirijwe muri studio mu 2007 utunganywa na Corneille. Ni umuzingo w'indirimbo uri mu rurimi rw'icyongereza ukaba utandukanye n'umuzingo wa mbere wa Corneille wari uri mu rurimi rw'igifaransa. Uyu muzingo w'indirimbo wesheje agahigo ko kuba warageze ku mwanya wa # 23 ku rutonde rw'imizingo y'indirimbo z\u2019igifaransa igumaho igihe kingana n'ibyumweru 14. Uyu muzingo w'indirimbo wakiriwe muri rusange n'urusobe rw'abakunzi be bayishimye ndetse n'abayinenze.\nUrutonde rw'indirimbo (2007).\nUmuzingo w'indirimbo w'umwimerere wasohowe na Wagram Music ndetse usohoka uriho indirimbo zikurikira\nUrutonde rw'indirimbo (2009).\nMu mwaka wa 2009, Universal Music yasohoye umuzingo w'indirimbo ufite izina rimwe nk'iryambere, wari urimo ibikoresho bishya no gukuraho indirimbo zimwe na zimwe zabonekaga ku mwimerere wasohowe na Wagram."}
